    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d389">

                <pb facs="0657" n="553" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg553"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">251.11 Insull, Samuel/14: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in Greece
                        (Morris)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-10-10T11:00:00-05:00">October 10,
                            1932—11 a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>49. Your 107, October 10, 11 a.m. In view of fact that only remaining formality
                    necessary to bring extradition treaty in force between United States and Greece
                    is exchange of ratifications,<anchor n="18" xml:id="d389-f1"/> Department
                    directs you to request provisional arrest and detention of Samuel Insull Senior
                    with a view to his extradition on the charges of embezzlement and larceny upon
                    which warrants of arrest have been issued in Cook County, Illinois.</p>
                <p>Amount involved in embezzlement is over $200 and in larceny over $25.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
